Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't let Lily's death be in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to strike while the target's eyes are still-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're demons! Fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you no compunctions about turning\Nyour own teammate into a bomb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, we're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was a good idea, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whenever we put on some weak-ass act,\Nhe sees right through us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Instead, we planted the bomb on you\Nwithout telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and waited for the two of you to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when we made my special\Nchili bomb go kablooey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:01:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The plan was for it to slow him down\Nlong enough for us all to pummel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And hey, usin' people without their knowledge\Nis a tactic we could use in real fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It failed spectacularly, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, our casualties were catastrophic!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess we needed something even more unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could have Lily fistfight the target\Non a dried-up riverbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then set off the bomb right as they go\Nfor a conciliatory handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could have Lily confess her love to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then set off the bomb the moment\Nthey exchange a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could send Lily out in the dead of winter\Nto look for a lost puppy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then set off the bomb when the target hugs her\Nto warm up her frozen shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why's it always me getting sacrificed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't sound sorry at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:47.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is there even really a point to this training?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is it actually gonna make me stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:54.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I still don't know how much I can trust that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:13.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Your big sister's gonna do her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this your little brother and sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the photo's from back at the orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you came from an orphanage?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Haven't been back much lately, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do your siblings know you're a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, my cover's that I'm workin' at\Na detective agency out in the sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I left, I made 'em a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:21.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that someday, I'd be filthy rich
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we'd all be able to live together happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're such a nice girl, Sybilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what're you talkin' about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I totally misunderstood you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All this time, I thought you were just\Na rude, uncivilized orangutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wanna take that comment back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it turns out, you're secretly\Na really kind orangutan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't take back shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's make this Impossible Mission a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll get a fat bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But first things first, we gotta take that punk down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And with that, let's get this strategy meeting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette says she's got some good news to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been monitoring Bro's communications, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's going into town today to pick up\Na top-secret document from a collaborator!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect chance for us to steal it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach will be at such a loss, he'll surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can beat him without ever\Nhaving to get in a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we need something stolen,\NI'd say that's right up Sybilla's alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this one solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I don't need backup, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That'll let me be more flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't having more people\Nmake it easier to tail him, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, have a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only way this goes south\Nis if there's a traitor like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is for you, Miss Sybilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems like this might take a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I packed you a lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:05:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can all just sit tight and wait for the good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:10.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Lotta people out today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:20.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I get any closer, he'll definitely make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is that where the top-secret document's hidden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:47.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Yeesh, the guy never leaves himself open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he'll get back before\NI have a chance to try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The hell does she think she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha-wha-wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I said I'd handle it solo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just thought, better safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured I could help out from behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With tailing that obvious,\Nyou're just gonna make my job harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Toodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got no one to blame but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He's eatin' lunch here, of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:32.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Against most people, this'd be plenty close for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Now, what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, would you like some juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fresh-squeezed orange juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I saw the box of pretty paints,\Nand I couldn't help myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I... I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't look so down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was just an accident-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You made her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm the bad guy here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Young lady, do you like cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good job reacting and stopping\Nthe pickpocket from that far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did a shoddy job tailing me,\Nbut that last bit was excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you knew I was there all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, completing missions will\Ndemand more speed still.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What you need is to be as quick as a thrust needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You apologizin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And Mister Sowing Man,\NI'm sorry for getting your nice clothes wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on that drink, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm Finé.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about I walk you home, Finé?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dunno why you ended up taggin' along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One thing led to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what all these people think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We kinda look like a couple, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It works in our favor to be seen as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We attract less attention that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, call me "Darling," Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is training too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,D-Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You thought I was being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You son of a...\NI swear, you're fuckin' dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you two not like each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope. I try to beat him up every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and he keeps mercilessly turnin' the tables on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've only been using one hand lately, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the part that pisses me off the most!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the same with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Papa always says that the only reason he gets mad\Nis because he loves me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:15.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This place looks sketchy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:18.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But hey, this could be my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I just reach over...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finé...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was it you were so preoccupied with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That juice was likely poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a thieving ring made up of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've heard there are lowlifes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who gather up orphans and\Nforce them to commit crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I set up shop in the park\Nin hopes they would show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and sure enough, they took the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean, this was your plan from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can use this to find where Finé is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to get your bag back while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm comin' too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is where the signal stopped moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, this is the thieves' hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you armed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is no good, Finé.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,None of this is worth more than chump change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You gotta start pulling your weight around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why can't you get that through your skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I wanna do is put good food\Non the table for you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just love you all so damn much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You love 'em, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Guys like you don't know the meaning of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just a couple of ordinary citizens\Nwith an ear for rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We heard there was a scumbag forcing children\Nto steal valuables for him to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You make me sound like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just looking after some kids\Nwho don't have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I teach 'em a trade, and I keep 'em clothed and fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm basically a social worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finé cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I did was reach for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and she started sobbin' like the world was ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Finé.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell's this guy been doin' to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bet you say the same damn thing\Nevery time you hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I only get mad 'cuz I care about you."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"This is how I show my love."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't go badmouthing\Nother people's teaching methods!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you think screaming and shouting's gonna\Nmake everything go your way, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've met loads of shitbags like you in my day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.25,0:14:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You come from the slums, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That explains why you've got such a mouth on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When mouthy kids start talking back to adults,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you gotta teach 'em some manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think you can take me, girlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Pandemonium...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time I cleaned you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:27.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I know that pain down in my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eat shit, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:37.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to become a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:40.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,So I could change this messed-up world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What you need is to be as quick as a thrust needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit dashing around, you little rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen, that's no kid toy-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The next one won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who the fuck are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A couple of ordinary citizens, like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, shut up so we can turn you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Calling the cops won't do shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a friend on the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be out of there in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only ones getting locked up here are you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You pointed a gun at a fine,\Nupstanding member of society!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the plan, girlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Soon, my cop buddy's gonna\Nput you away for attempted murder-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Inspector Angerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Military Intelligence Department is arresting him\Non charges of suspected espionage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ex-Captain Frisé.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-how do you know that name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:45.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Is that the top-secret document?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been rooting out an\NImperial spy's support network,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but of all the petty crooks we've turned up,\Nyou're the pettiest of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There were no signs you were holding down a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but to think that you were gathering up children\Nand making them do your dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You only got disciplinary sanctions for\Nthat ugly bar fight you started,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you won't be getting off that easily this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can atone for your many crimes in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no use running.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no one protecting you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Life as you know it is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The police will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll make sure the children get\Nplaced in proper institutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should get outta here\Nwhile the getting is good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gotta know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we complete the Impossible Mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is it gonna save a bunch of kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used to be just like Finé.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until I got to the orphanage,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I lived in a shitty slum
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and spent my whole life\Njust protecting my kid siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I chose to become a spy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'cuz I wanted to change this fucked-up world of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that choice gonna lead me\Nto the world I want it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That should go without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I gotta get stronger, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to get so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.63,0:18:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Defeating that man should have shown you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeking out strength for its own sake is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The most important thing for a spy to have\Nisn't a strong body,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's a strong heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you've already got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someday, this nation's children will owe you a debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You actually are a decent teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to guide you all to greatness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or my name isn't the World's Strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I will say, though, I am pretty hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I missed my chance to eat lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I've got a boxed lunch, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-Wanna share it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't actually make it myself,\Nthe others just kinda gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.96,0:19:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice!\NLet's go halvsies, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First things first...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should remove the transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the one you stuck on\Nso you could follow Finé?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:19:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The transmitter was there from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.17,0:20:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just happened to have a receiver that\Ncould pick up its wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, bucko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You used my own trick against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I can explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?! Try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice that they're having fun.\N{\rSubtitle-3}Also, quit running away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:26.83,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss Sybilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Lily told me to give you that lunchbox,\Nso I didn't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really didn't need you telling her that, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get your ass back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say it yourself, Sybilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Usin' people without their knowledge is\Na tactic we could use in real fights,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:53.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and "We need something even more unexpected."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were showing off by saying stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just doing what I had to to defeat Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-we stuck a chili bomb in the lunchbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, I followed you super obviously so you\Nwouldn't figure out what we were really up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when the timing was just right,\Nwe set off the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was the perfect plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll notice that I'm the only one\Ncovered in chili powder right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:22.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Turnabout is fair play, so why are you so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you just mad because we were listening\Nto your whole conversation with Teach
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we'd know when to blow the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you sounded so maidenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I've got a boxed lunch, y'know."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was like listening to a pair of innocent young lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tell you, we couldn't get the grins off\Nour faces when we heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll just punch you 'til you forget!\NIt's punching time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get back here, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Deceive each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Trick each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Improve each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep at it, and you'll be strong enough\Nto defeat me someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.75,0:22:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until then, though, the occasional\Nquarrel between teammates
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,can be magnificent too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:36.92,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,619.2)}{\an7}During the Pre-Impossible Mission Training
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:46.00,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,165.6)}{\an7}SPY CLASSROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:58.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,612)}{\an7}FILE: Pandemonium Sybilla
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:25.50,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,144)}{\an7}FILE: Pandemonium Sybilla
